      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "server",
      "stage": "mqtt_fsm",
      "description": "The Broker MUST set the Session Present flag in the CONNACK packet accordingly, i.e., 0 to indicate a new Session to the Client and 1 to indicate that the existing Session is continued.",
